---
title: "Krewire — One Go Framework for Every Workload"
description: "Unified Go Framework for every workload — app, cli, site, book, worker, service, infra, runtime. One CLI kiw, one config."
layout: Landing
---

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">Unified Go Framework{{with .Version}} · {{.}}{{end}} · Open Source</div>
      <h1>One Go Framework.<br>Every Workload.</h1>
      <p class="lead">From CLI to site, book to infra — one framework, one CLI <code>kiw</code>, one config <code>krewire.yaml</code>. Go-first, zero JS until you need it.</p>
      <div class="ctas">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/docs/getting-started">Get Started →</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/krewire/krewire" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>★</span> View on GitHub</a>
      </div>
      <div class="meta">Go 1.22+ · File-based routing · Scoped CSS · No JS by default</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art">
      {{component "CodeWindow" .}}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TRUST BAR -->
<section class="trust">
  <div class="trust-inner">
    <span class="trust-label">One config, eight workloads</span>
    <div class="trust-items">
      <span>One CLI <code>kiw</code></span>
      <span class="dot">·</span>
      <span>One config <code>krewire.yaml</code></span>
      <span class="dot">·</span>
      <span>8 workloads</span>
      <span class="dot">·</span>
      <span>100% Go</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section class="features">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>One framework. Eight workloads.</h2>
      <p>From static site to microservice — same Go, same <code>kiw</code>. Add only what you need, pay zero cost for what you don't.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "▲" "Title" "app" "Desc" "Fullstack monolith — web + API in one binary. `kiw run`." )}}
      {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "›" "Title" "cli" "Desc" "Command-line apps with framework/tui. Bubbles-inspired." )}}
      {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "◧" "Title" "site" "Desc" "File-based .kiw DSL → static site. No JS by default." )}}
      {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "≡" "Title" "book" "Desc" "Manuscript → book via mdbind. Markdown → site." )}}
      {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "⚙" "Title" "worker" "Desc" "Job queues, cron, retries, DLQ via framework/worker." )}}
      {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "⬢" "Title" "service" "Desc" "Registry, gateway, resilience, tracing via service." )}}
      {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "☁" "Title" "infra" "Desc" "Provider-agnostic IaC → AWS/K8s via framework/infra." )}}
      {{component "FeatureCard" (dict "Icon" "◈" "Title" "runtime" "Desc" "Go→WASM, VDOM, islands, hydration via runtime." )}}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="how">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>Three commands. Zero toolchain.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <h3>kiw new</h3>
        <p>Scaffold a <code>site</code>, <code>book</code>, <code>app</code> or <code>cli</code> in seconds.</p>
        <pre><code>kiw new my-site --site
cd my-site</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <h3>kiw build</h3>
        <p>Build static or binary. Scoped CSS, file-based routing, no config.</p>
        <pre><code>kiw build
# → .krewire/build/</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <h3>kiw deploy</h3>
        <p>Deploy to GitHub Pages or your infra. One command.</p>
        <pre><code>kiw deploy --target gh-pages</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY KREWIRE -->
<section class="why">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Go-first. Progressive. Zero bloat.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon">◈</div>
        <h3>Go-first</h3>
        <p>Write everything in Go. No JS toolchain until you opt into <code>runtime</code> WASM.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon">◧</div>
        <h3>File-based</h3>
        <p><code>pages/*.kiw</code> with frontmatter + HTML + scoped <code>&lt;style&gt;</code>. No config hell.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon">☰</div>
        <h3>One CLI</h3>
        <p><code>kiw build</code>, <code>kiw serve</code>, <code>kiw deploy</code> for every workload.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- DSL SHOWCASE -->
<section class="showcase">
  <div class="section-inner showcase-inner">
    <div>
      <h2>Write pages as <code>.kiw</code></h2>
      <p>Frontmatter + HTML + scoped CSS. No npm, no bundler.</p>
      <pre class="code"><code>---
title: Hello
layout: Base
---
&lt;h1&gt;{{"{{"}}.Title{{"}}"}}&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;style&gt;h1{color:var(--primary)}&lt;/style&gt;</code></pre>
      <div class="ctas">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/docs/dsl">Explore the DSL →</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/docs/getting-started">Read the docs →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="showcase-card">
      <div class="card-head">Why scoped CSS?</div>
      <p>Every <code>.kiw</code> component gets <code>data-kiw-component</code> scoping automatically. Like Svelte/Astro — zero setup, zero leaks.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>✓ Scoped by default</li>
        <li>✓ Global via <code>:root</code></li>
        <li>✓ Theme with <code>ui.Theme</code></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ECOSYSTEM -->
{{component "Ecosystem" .}}

<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<section class="final-cta">
  <div class="cta-card">
    <h2>Ready to build?</h2>
    <p>Start with a site, scale to a monolith, then to services — same repo, same CLI.</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="btn primary large" href="/docs/getting-started">Get Started — 5 min →</a>
      <a class="btn large" href="https://github.com/krewire/krewire" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Star on GitHub</a>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-meta"><code>kiw new my-app && cd my-app && kiw serve</code> — that's it.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.hero{padding:56px 0 24px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-2) 70%, var(--bg)), var(--bg))}
.hero-inner{max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}
.hero h1{font-family:ui-serif, Georgia, serif;font-size:56px;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 16px}
.hero .lead{font-size:18px;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 72%, var(--muted));max-width:560px;margin:0}
.hero .lead code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:13px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:8px}
.ctas{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;transition:all .15s}
.btn:hover{border-color:var(--fg);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn.primary{background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-content);border-color:var(--primary)}
.btn.primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.05)}
.btn.large{padding:12px 22px;font-size:15px}
.meta{margin-top:18px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.trust{border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-2)}
.trust-inner{max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.trust-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.trust-items{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);flex-wrap:wrap}
.trust-items code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:12px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px}
.trust-items .dot{opacity:.4}
.features{padding:48px 0 24px}
.section-inner{max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px}
.section-head{max-width:720px;margin:0 0 32px}
.section-head h2{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 10px}
.section-head p{color:var(--muted);margin:0;font-size:15px}
.section-head p code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:13px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}
.how{padding:32px 0;background:var(--bg-2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.step{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:20px}
.step-num{width:32px;height:32px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:999px;background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-content);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px}
.step h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px}
.step p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.step pre{margin:0;background:#0a0a0a;color:#e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;overflow:auto}
.step code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:12px}
.why{padding:48px 0}
.why-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.why-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;background:var(--bg)}
.why-icon{width:40px;height:40px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:14px}
.why-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px}
.why-card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}
.why-card code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:12px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:6px}
.showcase{padding:40px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.showcase-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:24px;align-items:start}
.showcase h2{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.showcase p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}
.showcase .code{margin:0;background:#0a0a0a;color:#e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;overflow:auto;font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}
.showcase-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;background:var(--bg-2)}
.card-head{font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px}
.showcase-card p{font-size:13px}
.showcase-card ul{margin:16px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.showcase-card code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:12px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:6px}
.final-cta{padding:40px 0 56px}
.cta-card{max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-2), var(--bg));text-align:center}
.cta-card h2{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.cta-card p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 20px}
.cta-card .ctas{justify-content:center}
.cta-meta{margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.cta-meta code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px}
@media(max-width:900px){
  .hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}
  .hero h1{font-size:42px}
  .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .why-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .showcase-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media(max-width:560px){
  .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero{padding:32px 0 16px}
  .features{padding:32px 0 16px}
}
</style>
